From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: V3 Gold <v3gold@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:20:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] V3 Gold: 4:3 and full-screen screen shapes

The in-game menu's screen shape (renderer/gold_lab.h, from the app's overlay)
decides where the game's picture goes on the screen, for both renderers and
every screen filter: Vita3K's own 16:9, 4:3 showing the middle of the picture,
4:3 with the whole picture squeezed in, or the whole screen. Touch and the
overlays follow the same rectangle.
---
 .../include/renderer/vulkan/screen_filters.h  |  2 ++
 vita3k/renderer/src/gl/renderer.cpp           | 22 ++++++++++++++-
 vita3k/renderer/src/vulkan/renderer.cpp       | 17 +++++++++++-
 vita3k/renderer/src/vulkan/screen_filters.cpp | 27 +++++++++++++++++--
 4 files changed, 64 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/vita3k/renderer/include/renderer/vulkan/screen_filters.h b/vita3k/renderer/include/renderer/vulkan/screen_filters.h
index e005a24..f6ae648 100644
